Usage of golem models:
  -allow-destination value
    	admit a remote model destination: "<provider>/<canonical base URL>" (repeatable; this command never prompts)
  -base-url string
    	override the openai-compat backend base URL (server root, without /v1); used as given, disables discovery
  -config string
    	path to models.json (default: auto-discover)
  -json
    	emit the configview snapshot as JSON (no probing; excludes -probe-all/-reprobe)
  -no-probe
    	disable openai-compat backend port discovery; explicit and configured URLs are still used as resolved
  -ollama-url string
    	override Ollama base URL
  -probe-all
    	actively probe every non-explicit entry (no bounded-eager stop)
  -reprobe
    	delete cached probe verdicts for non-explicit entries then re-probe
  -root string
    	workspace root (scopes the cap-probe cache path guard) (default ".")
